{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "4bf1aae9-5992-5d58-bc0f-f16ff15f0d10", "source_ordinal": 4057, "reading_ordinal": 4290, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "医人心者", "published_at": "2026-09-16T08:53:18.282000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/2079543836381132308/answer/2083478260592145172"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "心脏不好的人，适合从事仪式性的服务。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 18}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "去学习那些日复一日，行礼如仪、沉静如水的操练。", "char_start": 19, "char_end": 42}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "举点例子——", "char_start": 43, "char_end": 49}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "茶道，插花，香道。", "char_start": 50, "char_end": 59}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "太极拳，瑜伽，弓道。", "char_start": 60, "char_end": 70}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "传统剧目——筝、琴、琵琶。", "char_start": 71, "char_end": 84}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "书画艺术——工笔画、瓷画、雕刻、书法。", "char_start": 85, "char_end": 104}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这些类型的技艺没有体力上的巨大挑战，不涉及激烈互动，而且越是高水平，越是需要心静如水、物我两忘。", "char_start": 105, "char_end": 153}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "无论是练习还是服务，全程都是安静、受控、没有意外惊吓的。", "char_start": 154, "char_end": 182}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "而且是越练越有信心，越安定从容。而一旦练成了，也都可以指引其他人练习和体验。", "char_start": 183, "char_end": 221}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "如今世界焦躁不安，这份平静和笃定是吸引人的，进入这个平静的世界能力是珍贵的。", "char_start": 222, "char_end": 260}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "你正好因为心伤不能不平静，还有什么比这更好的驱动条件呢？", "char_start": 261, "char_end": 289}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "你能自医，便可医人。", "char_start": 290, "char_end": 300}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "医人心者，自难抑郁。", "char_start": 301, "char_end": 311}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 14}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0609"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：先天心脏不太好的人该如何变得有趣、不容易抑郁呢？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014"], "summary": "围绕“医人心者”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“心脏不好的人，适合从事仪式性的服务。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "心脏不好的人，适合从事仪式性的服务。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 18, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "0e00b591-7ad6-5ddc-93ce-b474d9d06c1b", "source_ordinal": 4056, "reading_ordinal": 4291, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "两味解药", "published_at": "2026-09-16T15:21:32.926000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/419749636/answer/2083576110906979625"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "先不说该不该，就说这怎么操作：", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 15}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "电话号码换掉？工作单位换掉？自己房子卖掉？父母的房子也卖掉？自己主持的节目停掉？开办的企业注销掉？媒体账号注销掉？", "char_start": 16, "char_end": 73}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这些线索不全断，就算是对方完全不做主动联系，仅仅是正常的生活着、工作着，都自然会有状态信息外泄。", "char_start": 74, "char_end": 122}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "是的，你心魔未除，自己忍不住时不时窥伺，常常受到这些信息的刺激——你可能希望对方流露对你的怀念，希望对方因为失去你而长期痛苦，甚至希望对方就此再也没有获得亲密关系。", "char_start": 123, "char_end": 205}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "又或者希望看到某种复合的机会。", "char_start": 206, "char_end": 221}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这些念头每天引诱着你，你抗拒失败，去看了，没看到令自己满意的东西，观看本身又会折磨你。", "char_start": 222, "char_end": 265}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这种反复的纠缠、拉扯，撕心裂肺，没完没了，你知道这不对、这没用，但你就是停不下来——似乎唯一轻松的办法，就只能是对方“死掉”。", "char_start": 266, "char_end": 329}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "但就像上面所说的——这基本办不到。", "char_start": 330, "char_end": 347}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这折磨唯一的解，就是要凭爱分手。", "char_start": 348, "char_end": 364}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "分手的逻辑只能是因为你爱ta，确实已经尽了最大的努力，但因为形格势禁、造化弄人，又或者是因为人各有志，这份感情只要继续，会带给对方的伤害就会多过滋养，所以恰恰因为爱，必须要放手让对方离开。", "char_start": 365, "char_end": 459}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "也许换个时间，换个条件，结果会有所不同，但是此生此世、此时此刻，看来是天意如此，我们没得勉强。", "char_start": 460, "char_end": 507}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "不是我不爱你，奈何我的爱对你是伤害，而且天意坚决。", "char_start": 508, "char_end": 533}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "所以我以“唯愿你过得好”的心愿，顺从天意的安排放手。", "char_start": 534, "char_end": 560}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "我相信天意对我们都是善良的，既然它如此坚持，必有它的道理，强要违逆，害人害己。", "char_start": 561, "char_end": 600}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "所以我放心把你托付给命运，相信这之后的一切都对你是最好的。", "char_start": 601, "char_end": 630}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "我也相信自己继续向前，迎向新的安排也是对你最好的安慰。", "char_start": 631, "char_end": 658}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "因为一个以这样的心思离开你的人，你也必牵挂，我若过得不开心、不健康、不阳光，对你也是一种折磨。", "char_start": 659, "char_end": 706}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "我也没办法成为“死去的前任”。", "char_start": 707, "char_end": 722}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "凭爱分手，而且敬畏命运，是对抗分手后种种负面情绪冲动的根本解药。", "char_start": 723, "char_end": 755}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "遗憾的是这世上有太多的冤情——本不是因为爱而聚首，于是在分离时因为缺少爱而难解纠缠和怨恨，最后只能以一方忍无可忍而硬性逃离，而在分开之后，又因为“不认命、不信运”而永无休止的纠缠。", "char_start": 756, "char_end": 846}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "是缺这两味解药，“死前任”才能了唯一理想解。却又偏偏，没有这两味心药，又特别容易分手。", "char_start": 847, "char_end": 890}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "没有爱是不行的，切切不要抱侥幸，仅仅因为容貌、家财之类的引诱而轻易开启基于贪婪的关系，否则处久了易成地狱，要分手甚至会陷入更深的无间地狱。", "char_start": 891, "char_end": 960}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "爱本来就珍稀，尽量别再在它之上叠加太多家世、容貌之类的条件了。", "char_start": 961, "char_end": 992}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 25}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0609"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：合格的前任应该像死了一样吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023"], "summary": "围绕“两味解药”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“先不说该不该，就说这怎么操作：”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "先不说该不该，就说这怎么操作：", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 15, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "1eff23d5-82ae-5564-9106-f219eaeb847d", "source_ordinal": 4055, "reading_ordinal": 4292, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "我的大学", "published_at": "2026-09-17T10:13:43.487000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/2080628701679588290/answer/2083860713517462186"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "学管理生活日程，心理安稳，生理健康。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 18}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "学宿舍生活，处理小空间的人情世故。", "char_start": 19, "char_end": 36}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "学同学相处，处理具体群体内的利益矛盾。", "char_start": 37, "char_end": 56}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "学和老师处理关系，学会向上管理。", "char_start": 57, "char_end": 73}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "学健康恋爱，成与不成，迈出人生步伐。", "char_start": 74, "char_end": 92}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "学利用学校学术资源，打造宽泛知识和技能基座，磨练学习技能本身。", "char_start": 93, "char_end": 124}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "学有效争取荣誉和体系认可，打下个人品牌底子。", "char_start": 125, "char_end": 147}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "学打工实习和接触实际项目，祛魅祛恐，早点接受摔打磨砺，把皮练厚、心练韧，磨去孩子气。", "char_start": 148, "char_end": 190}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "利用宽松自由的环境，探索自己的信仰和志向。", "char_start": 191, "char_end": 212}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "以上这些和具体的专业其实没有绝对的关系，无论怎么跳槽改行，也不会失去其价值。", "char_start": 213, "char_end": 251}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "大学期间的首要任务，其实是从高中生成长为一个情绪稳定、令人乐于亲近和信任的成年人——一个可持续的，有技巧，有经验的好人。", "char_start": 252, "char_end": 312}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "这是一辈子的功课，是人类真正的本专业。", "char_start": 313, "char_end": 332}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "不会踏空的。", "char_start": 333, "char_end": 339}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 13}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0609"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如果毕业后不从事本专业，那大学四年究竟要学什么？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013"], "summary": "围绕“我的大学”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“学管理生活日程，心理安稳，生理健康。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "学管理生活日程，心理安稳，生理健康。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 18, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "02015a58-2d7f-5aad-9f5e-5eebfcda03b2", "source_ordinal": 4053, "reading_ordinal": 4293, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "生门", "published_at": "2026-09-18T19:00:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/2083262219391968613/answer/2083702389173903970"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "我们为孩子们设立的安全保障太少了。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 17}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "太少了。", "char_start": 18, "char_end": 22}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "一旦主线断裂，不是往下跌一个台阶、等下一班车，而是一旦断线，人会从半山腰直接坠落山谷，身负重伤。", "char_start": 23, "char_end": 71}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "侥幸未死，也要从山谷里重新攀登。", "char_start": 72, "char_end": 88}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "中考不利，职高和普高人生分流；高考不利，本科和大专左右殊途；导师不行，学位难产，人生退无可退。", "char_start": 89, "char_end": 136}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "走职业体育的，关键时候受个伤，甚至资格登记被随便什么部门卡一卡，少盖个章，错过了一场比赛，就可能错过进入职业道路的机会，十年伤痛，付之流水。", "char_start": 137, "char_end": 207}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "有太多决定命运的时刻，一旦抽到短签，就有沉重的打击。而且登得越高，踏空冲击越重。", "char_start": 208, "char_end": 248}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "在这个话题下，有无数的人控诉学校、医院、导师、社会。", "char_start": 249, "char_end": 275}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "道理确实是有道理，也是该批评，但这背后的种种机制结成的结，不是这么容易开解的。", "char_start": 276, "char_end": 315}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "远水救不了近火。", "char_start": 316, "char_end": 324}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "真正使得上力的，只有家庭、朋友、爱人在踏空下坠时担任安全网、缓冲垫。", "char_start": 325, "char_end": 359}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "无论如何要给孩子托住啊。", "char_start": 360, "char_end": 372}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "他一旦站上了高台，只有你们平时的开解能拉住他的心。", "char_start": 373, "char_end": 398}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "要多说“天无绝人之路”“船到桥头自然直”。", "char_start": 399, "char_end": 420}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "多说“你的才智和勤奋都不坏，就算一路不通，总还有一路”。", "char_start": 421, "char_end": 449}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "要多说“还有我们”。", "char_start": 450, "char_end": 460}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "社会给孩子加的压已经足够了，家人要做的是减压，是把被外部压力毁坏的信心补回来，护住孩子的乐观。", "char_start": 461, "char_end": 508}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "我真希望能把这话说到更多的父母、亲人们心里。", "char_start": 509, "char_end": 531}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "到了关头，这可能是生死的差别。", "char_start": 532, "char_end": 547}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 19}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0609"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：南方医科大学一名本博连读医学生坠亡，校方通报称经警方勘查，确认为高坠身亡，排除他杀，哪些信息值得关注？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019"], "summary": "围绕“生门”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“我们为孩子们设立的安全保障太少了。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "我们为孩子们设立的安全保障太少了。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 17, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "492b5110-a59f-5544-93a0-2347a2e979a8", "source_ordinal": 4051, "reading_ordinal": 4294, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "镇北安南", "published_at": "2026-09-18T19:00:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/2082261043515072893/answer/2084001228296667703"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "镇北，是因为北方少数民族是未受敕封、不在中华体系内的异族南侵。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 31}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "安南，是因为南方基本是已受敕封，进入中华体系后的地区动乱。", "char_start": 32, "char_end": 61}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "要么是汉人移民和当地少数民族的主客矛盾爆发，要么是和天朝关系不大的土著藩国内部篡逆夺权这类的内乱。只是原王室会请求安南都护之类的角色“扶持正统”，协助平乱。", "char_start": 62, "char_end": 140}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "南方的藩国动乱诉求是很有限的，很多时候只是主张保持独立性或者抗拒天朝对他们内部事务的插手。没有谁有动过“打到都城去，弄个天子当”的念头。", "char_start": 141, "char_end": 209}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "甚至基本没谁动过夺取中国一片本土的奢望——说全然没有这类妄人也不确实，的确有些南方政权在模糊的中间地带试探，但基本上最后的结局都一样，无非是有人扛得久一点，有人扛得短一点，最后都不得不退回原位。", "char_start": 210, "char_end": 307}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "南方藩国的相对优势只有热带丛林和山地作战，完全没有能力在内河河面或稍微宽阔的平原丘陵地带和中原的专业部队相持，可以说就算勉强雄起了，直接放着不动，只凭长期贸易制裁，等雄主身故，这些藩国内部就有很多人不满，一切都会自然退回原状。", "char_start": 308, "char_end": 421}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "因此古代中国对南方动乱的政策一般都是安抚、平定动乱，恢复秩序和治安。", "char_start": 422, "char_end": 456}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "而“安”这个字，是“女坐家中”，用在南方战略上，贴切之极。", "char_start": 457, "char_end": 486}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "北方蛮族则完全相反——如果长城体系没拦住，黄河以北几乎无险可守，北方骑兵在越过长城防线后反而会威力进一步放大，更不提黄河以北还有大量汉文明精华区域，地方豪强走避不及，如果蛮族政权久占不退，而且zz意识不过于封闭，几乎必然获得滞留豪强的一定合作，形成辽、金、元、后金这类的长期政权。", "char_start": 487, "char_end": 627}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "为什么要用镇？", "char_start": 628, "char_end": 635}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "镇这个东西，其实是一个寝具，用来压住翘起的席子角，以免翘起来的席角绊到人，更避免意外卷起把席子上的茶几灯具一股脑掀翻。", "char_start": 636, "char_end": 695}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "席镇baike.baidu.com/item/%E5%B8%AD%E9%95%87/5609928", "char_start": 696, "char_end": 745}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "不得不说，这个比喻实在传神。", "char_start": 746, "char_end": 760}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 13}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0609"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么很多小说或电视剧里都是镇北侯，怎么没有镇南侯？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013"], "summary": "围绕“镇北安南”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“镇北，是因为北方少数民族是未受敕封、不在中华体系内的异族南侵。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "镇北，是因为北方少数民族是未受敕封、不在中华体系内的异族南侵。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 31, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "7dd438cc-4b8d-538f-98fa-607b65c8ab3b", "source_ordinal": 4054, "reading_ordinal": 4295, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "苦方", "published_at": "2026-09-18T19:00:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/554795652/answer/2083293546610799157"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "你这个“每天比ta多练两小时”要是不是因为沉迷于演奏的快乐，而是因为爹妈的逼迫、自己对落后的不甘心、老师的严厉威胁……等等这些念头，将来越练越觉得自己毫无天赋的概率极大。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 85}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "练得越多，反而越快越深的证明自己资质有限，放弃得越快。", "char_start": 86, "char_end": 113}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这不是说有天赋的练习者没有爹妈催逼、没有老师严厉、没有自己的得失心纠结，但这些在练习中其实是负面因素，只是因为它们虽然有毒性，但终究没有压倒自己在演奏、练习中仍能体会到的乐趣，所以才护住了心脉和最终的热情，并在热情克化了这些毒素后反而心跳有力、艺术生命变强了。", "char_start": 114, "char_end": 244}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这份能压住种种扫兴的找到快乐的能力，就是天赋。", "char_start": 245, "char_end": 268}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "heading", "index": 5, "text": "天赋有一个天然的特征——它不在乎什么谁比谁强。", "char_start": 269, "char_end": 292}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "我不如你，关我很喜欢什么事？", "char_start": 293, "char_end": 307}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "我不如你，我还是喜欢啊。", "char_start": 308, "char_end": 320}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "我爱吹这唢呐，我吹的很多人觉得难听，说我不着调、不靠谱、没拍子，不登大雅之堂。", "char_start": 321, "char_end": 360}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "然而我就是喜欢吹。", "char_start": 361, "char_end": 370}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "我的喜欢即使扣除这些恶评差评带给我的痛苦，仍然绰绰有余。", "char_start": 371, "char_end": 399}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "我当然追求着靠谱、合拍，但是未能靠谱、未能合拍的沮丧仍然不能让我的享受归零。", "char_start": 400, "char_end": 438}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "所以我一直吹、一直吹，照着让我自己灵魂出窍的远处一直吹。", "char_start": 439, "char_end": 467}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "最后迷住观众的，其实根本就不是我的什么技法，而是这份穿透了无数谩骂和羞辱、自疑和沮丧，捅穿了地狱的大门，无礼无状、酩酊大醉，闯进天堂的快乐。", "char_start": 468, "char_end": 538}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "观众没谱没调，我没羞没臊，他们喜欢的是能让一个人快乐至此的东西，无论这东西看上去如何、听上去如何，它都不再受到任何“质量体系”的评价。", "char_start": 539, "char_end": 606}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "我的快乐和沉醉，就是我的“质量”。", "char_start": 607, "char_end": 624}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "已经没有比大小、分优劣的余地，因为我的肖邦是我的肖邦，你的命运是你的命运。", "char_start": 625, "char_end": 662}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "艺术的尽头是无法估价的自由，不是什么狗屁“我不如你、你不如我”。", "char_start": 663, "char_end": 695}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "毕加索漂亮吗？周星驰优雅吗？毕加索比安格尔“不如”吗？", "char_start": 696, "char_end": 723}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "怎么比的？", "char_start": 724, "char_end": 729}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "你觉得到底什么叫努力？", "char_start": 730, "char_end": 741}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "是苦吗？", "char_start": 742, "char_end": 746}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "是化苦为甜的不懈尝试。", "char_start": 747, "char_end": 758}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "所谓天赋，就在这苦中尝得到甜的敏感。", "char_start": 759, "char_end": 777}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "努力的结果，是你那道独特的秘方。", "char_start": 778, "char_end": 794}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "取将人人皆知的苦，化为人人未见的甜。", "char_start": 795, "char_end": 813}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "这无法评分、无法比较、无从替代的秘方，才是你努力的结果。", "char_start": 814, "char_end": 842}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "不是“比人强”。", "char_start": 843, "char_end": 851}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "强你妹强。", "char_start": 852, "char_end": 857}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 27, "heading": 1}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0609"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：练琴努力真的抵得过天赋吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028"], "summary": "围绕“苦方”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“你这个“每天比ta多练两小时”要是不是因为沉迷于演奏的快乐，而是因为爹妈的逼迫、自己对落后的不甘心、老师的严厉威胁……等等这些念头，将来越练越觉得自己毫无天赋的概率极大。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "你这个“每天比ta多练两小时”要是不是因为沉迷于演奏的快乐，而是因为爹妈的逼迫、自己对落后的不甘心、老师的严厉威胁……等等这些念头，将来越练越觉得自己毫无天赋的概率极大。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 85, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "d4833e93-aff8-5846-9e11-a7726d48c410", "source_ordinal": 4052, "reading_ordinal": 4296, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "石头缝", "published_at": "2026-09-18T19:00:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/12150562405/answer/2084283983710503345"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这话里面有一个非常特殊的隐含问题——中国的市场条件、群众基础和西方主导的美学观念有根本的错位，导致一个作品很难同时在两个不同的价值评价体系里获得好评。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 75}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "然而我们的文艺工作者从苏联时代开始，经过改开、全球化的持续教育，几乎是从西方艺术观里成长起来的。", "char_start": 76, "char_end": 124}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "从小老师也罢、自己看的电影也罢、前辈也罢、学院也罢，层层叠叠形成了一个“什么叫好电影”的标准，ta们也是老老实实按照这些平生所学去做的，这在中美蜜月期、中国全力拥抱全球化的时代也非常奏效，因此爆发了一代中国电影的热潮。", "char_start": 125, "char_end": 234}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "问题是现在中美对抗，时过境迁了。即使不说对一些价值追求态度完全反转，至少也是兴趣重点发生了很大的切换。", "char_start": 235, "char_end": 286}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "以前头痛要医头，现在脚痛还医头——因为只学会医头——这终究是不行的。", "char_start": 287, "char_end": 321}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "然而中国电影特殊的资本、人才、发行体制，导致了制作发行端拥有了过大的垄断霸权。所有的银幕都是我的，最后的拍摄都是从我们一群人的，无论如何这都是十四亿人的市场，我就算拍错了、有问题，只要我在制作端把实际硬成本压得够低，在14亿人的海里总可以打到一些鱼。", "char_start": 322, "char_end": 447}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "垄断优势带来的容错优势，总是要到被耗尽之后才会推动行为的改变。", "char_start": 448, "char_end": 479}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "资本一轮轮借助营销和渠道优势无视艺术本该有的回应人心、治愈人心的责任，与艺术系统长期满足于“在西方的比赛里追上西方”的模仿追随，这两个因素合流，再叠加上现在经济承压、人心郁结的痛苦，把这个矛盾激化到了极点。", "char_start": 480, "char_end": 583}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "医生只学了医头，医院仗着所有的门诊都是自己开的，懒得医脚，而患者则越是脚疼，越是愤恨这整个安排，也以报复的心态给予惩罚性的回应。", "char_start": 584, "char_end": 648}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "这基本就是现在电影行业的僵局。", "char_start": 649, "char_end": 664}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "这僵局现在在走向一个古怪的方向——路边出现了大量的游医，开出大量的小方子争夺市场。", "char_start": 665, "char_end": 706}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "这些小方子未必完全没有医治心灵饥渴的用心，但是绝大多数都更倾向于大量掺合欣快剂、麻醉剂，追求“立竿见影的效果”。", "char_start": 707, "char_end": 763}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "最起码在现在是暂时满足了大众的急需的。", "char_start": 764, "char_end": 783}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "但真实的问题仍然存在——对大篇幅的、更严肃和深刻的艺术的需求并没有真正的减退，它只是因为结构性的僵局而卡住了。", "char_start": 784, "char_end": 839}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "艺术界、资本方不可能永远拒绝适应新的时代需求，一定会有一些英勇的团队借助新的路径和新的技术在这僵局里找到裂缝开出花来，然后启发出新的方向。", "char_start": 840, "char_end": 909}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "艺术天生是干这种钻岩缝、悬崖生松柏的活的，就像生物无论遇到多大的天灾，总会在最初的大败之后生出以前未能想象的适应，在上一代难以想象的苛刻环境里再次繁荣起来一样。", "char_start": 910, "char_end": 990}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "甚至可以说——恰恰是现在这样极度的萧条，反而是孕育新探索的温床。", "char_start": 991, "char_end": 1023}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "等着新英雄从石头缝里蹦出来就是。", "char_start": 1024, "char_end": 1040}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "新的答案一定令我们惊喜，耐心等待就是。", "char_start": 1041, "char_end": 1060}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 19}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0609"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：“中国有那么多垃圾电影，就是因为有太多的垃圾观众”如何评价这句话？?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019"], "summary": "围绕“石头缝”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这话里面有一个非常特殊的隐含问题——中国的市场条件、群众基础和西方主导的美学观念有根本的错位，导致一个作品很难同时在两个不同的价值评价体系里获得好评。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这话里面有一个非常特殊的隐含问题——中国的市场条件、群众基础和西方主导的美学观念有根本的错位，导致一个作品很难同时在两个不同的价值评价体系里获得好评。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 75, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
